{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53838","headline":"与李频诗 · 李绅","name":"与李频诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸬鷀山头片云晴，扬州城里见潮生。\n（见宋胡仔《苕溪渔隐丛话前集》卷二四《蔡宽夫诗话》引、《嘉定镇江志》卷二二）（按：《全唐诗》卷一三三李颀《送刘昱》云：「鸬鷀山头微雨晴，扬州城里暮潮生。\n」与此二句极相似，未详系蔡氏误记，抑爲李绅用李颀之成句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}